@startuml
title Figure 1. ResourceHive System Context
left to right direction

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false

actor Visitor
actor Member
actor "Organization Admin" as OrgAdmin
actor "Platform Admin" as PlatformAdmin
actor "System Operator" as Operator

rectangle "ResourceHive Platform" as System

cloud "Email Provider" as Email
cloud "OAuth Provider\n(optional)" as OAuth
database "PostgreSQL" as Database
cloud "DNS / HTTPS" as Network

Visitor --> System : Register and log in
Member --> System : Find and book resources
OrgAdmin --> System : Manage members and resources
PlatformAdmin --> System : Manage tenants
Operator --> System : Deploy and monitor

System --> Email : Send emails
System --> OAuth : Link accounts
System --> Database : Store data
System --> Network : Public access
@enduml
